  "atomic_questions": [
    "Are the annual fighter jet production figures a1 = 10 and a2 = 15 the total number of jets produced in year 1 and year 2 respectively, or do they represent some other quantity such as the number of jets available for allocation after accounting for prior-year carryover?"
